Tmail
Modified and integrated by tiouoo, 2026-11-07.

This project includes code adapted from oiov/vmail:
https://github.com/oiov/vmail
Upstream commit: 0213e65cc555f7ef8ea38b34712afd6e20aa3eaa
Classic first-email recovery reference: dc8a25c (parent of 7865745).
Upstream author: oiov and contributors.
License: GPL-3.0-only (see LICENSE).

Adapted files:
- src/worker/hash.js: JavaScript adaptation of the credential hashing
  function in worker/src/key-token.ts. External API Key features were removed.
- src/worker/mailbox-token.js: JavaScript adaptation of the mailbox credential
  functions in worker/src/sender.ts.
  These signatures now authorize internal requests and sessions only.

Readable mailbox names use a local word list and Web Crypto to combine two
to five words with randomly selected dot, hyphen, or underscore separators.

The Tmail interface, Turso integration, internal mailbox routes, caching, and deployment
structure were rewritten for this repository. This work is provided under
GPL-3.0-only, without warranty. Branding has changed; upstream authorship is retained.
